  "description": {
   "en": "At work, she’s the perfect career woman. But after she leaves, she lives the life of a carefully hidden otaku—Haeyoung. Her peaceful double life begins to shake when she meets a “freaking handsome cosplayer” at the venue of a weekend gaming event. \n\nThe identity of that extravagant cosplayer is none other than Juyeon, the quiet and invisible nerd from her company!\n\nThe two, who have never exchanged even a word of small talk, end up sharing a secret against their will, and Juyeon makes an unexpected proposal to Haeyoung, the very person who asked him to keep it hidden…\n\nWill this relationship really remain safe until the end?"
  },
